00:22:02.500 --> 00:22:06.210
A task because it's
a to-do application.

00:22:06.210 --> 00:22:08.230
I can start creating
fields for a task.

00:22:08.230 --> 00:22:09.830
Now what kind of
fields do I need?

00:22:09.830 --> 00:22:11.800
I need to have a task name.

00:22:11.800 --> 00:22:13.860
So I create a string
