00:22:33.240 --> 00:22:34.070
yes or no.

00:22:34.070 --> 00:22:36.570
So I called the task
Fields Completed.

00:22:36.570 --> 00:22:38.200
It's a Boolean.

00:22:38.200 --> 00:22:39.040
All right.

00:22:39.040 --> 00:22:40.440
I switch back to the page.

