00:24:07.670 --> 00:24:11.040
And now I can start
creating another page.

00:24:11.040 --> 00:24:15.790
This will be up pop up
for creating a new task.

00:24:15.790 --> 00:24:16.290
Yes.

00:24:19.120 --> 00:24:22.150
I'll start dragging another
component on the screen.

00:24:22.150 --> 00:24:25.060
And in this case, it's a form.

00:24:25.060 --> 00:24:29.380
This is the Add form for
creating new task data.

00:24:29.380 --> 00:24:33.650
Again, through data binding,
it recognizes the model.

00:24:33.650 --> 00:24:35.680
I'm just changing
the layout here.

00:24:35.680 --> 00:24:38.470
So I want to make it
